#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:1
msgid "E0093"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unknown_constr_pat_on_exhaustive_type`"
msgstr "警告名：`unknown_constr_pat_on_exhaustive_type`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:5
msgid ""
"A `Type::..` pattern is used with an enum that is not marked "
"`#non_exhaustive`. Closed enums have no unknown future constructor for "
"this pattern to match, so the pattern is meaningless."
msgstr ""
"`#non_exhaustive` が付いていない enum に `Type::..` パターンが使われて"
"います。閉じた enum にはこのパターンがマッチする未知の将来コンストラクタが"
"ないため、このパターンには意味がありません。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(all) enum Status {\n"
"  Ready\n"
"  Busy\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn describe(status : Status) -> String {\n"
"  match status {\n"
"    Ready => \"ready\"\n"
"    Busy => \"busy\"\n"
"    Status::.. => \"unknown\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正案"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:17
msgid ""
"Remove the `Type::..` case from a closed enum match. If the enum is a "
"public extension point whose defining package may add constructors in "
"future releases, mark its declaration with `#non_exhaustive`, match every"
" currently known constructor explicitly, and keep `Type::..` as the final"
" compatibility case."
msgstr ""
"閉じた enum の match から `Type::..` ケースを削除してください。その enum が"
"公開拡張点であり、定義元パッケージが将来のリリースでコンストラクタを追加する"
"可能性がある場合は、宣言に `#non_exhaustive` を付け、現在既知のコンストラクタを"
"すべて明示的にマッチし、最後の互換性ケースとして `Type::..` を残します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0093.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#non_exhaustive\n"
"pub(all) enum Status {\n"
"  Ready\n"
"  Busy\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn describe(status : Status) -> String {\n"
"  match status {\n"
"    Ready => \"ready\"\n"
"    Busy => \"busy\"\n"
"    Status::.. => \"unknown\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
